This code covers the application logic in this repository (index.html and the
tools/ scripts). It does not extend to third-party assets bundled alongside
it, which carry their own terms — see audio/CREDITS.md for the audio files
(a mix of original synthesis and Pixabay Content License recordings) and the
comments in startziel-a4.svg / boxengasse-a4.svg for the printed track
patterns (derived from Carrera Hybrid's own track pieces, included here only
as a practical aid for owners of that hardware).
